 "part_files_reason": "The robot wears the V1.24/V1.25 two-half ankle (stock bracket cut at mid shaft: outer half on the horn, inner half on the V1.22 black sleeve, screwed together at the toe since 2026-10-23; microduck-sim/CURRENT-STATE.json ankle_bracket) with the V1.22 slip-fit feet: the guide/gate world files of guide/print/ankle-halves-20261020 and release-V1.22 (guide frame, mm). The guide's ankle and ankle_cheek keys draw these halves, but the files are named here so the model does not follow a later guide revision. The head shells are the 2026-10-20 A7Z head on the walking robot (V1.17 cap and face, V1.8 lower shell, original jaw support), while the guide has moved on to the extension head (U20 face, exit lower shell and jaw support, ear cap); each file matched the 2026-10-20 head meshes within their reduction error (99th percentile 0.3-1 mm) on 2026-10-24.",
